namespace NeoEngine { namespace {bool ValidSignal(FraudSignal s){switch(s){case FraudSignal::DuplicateReceipt:case FraudSignal::LedgerMismatch:case FraudSignal::ImpossibleInventory:return true;}return false;}} bool TrustSafetySystem::Valid(const std::string&id){if(id.empty()||id.size()>96)return false;for(unsigned char c:id)if(!std::isalnum(c)&&c!='-'&&c!='_'&&c!='.')return false;return true;} uint8_t TrustSafetySystem::Weight(FraudSignal s){return s==FraudSignal::DuplicateReceipt?3:5;} bool TrustSafetySystem::Report(std::string player,std::string event,FraudSignal signal){if(!Valid(player)||!Valid(event)||!ValidSignal(signal)||IsBanned(player)||m_Events.contains(event))return false;const uint8_t oldScore=Score(player),nextScore=static_cast<uint8_t>(std::min<int>(255,oldScore+Weight(signal)));bool insertedScore=false,insertedEvent=false,appendedAudit=false;try{const auto eventResult=m_Events.insert(event);if(!eventResult.second)return false;insertedEvent=true;const auto scoreResult=m_Scores.emplace(player,oldScore);insertedScore=scoreResult.second;scoreResult.first->second=nextScore;m_Audit.push_back({player,event,signal,nextScore});appendedAudit=true;if(nextScore>=8)m_Banned.insert(player);}catch(const std::bad_alloc&){if(appendedAudit)m_Audit.pop_back();if(insertedScore)m_Scores.erase(player);else{const auto scoreIt=m_Scores.find(player);if(scoreIt!=m_Scores.end())scoreIt->second=oldScore;}if(insertedEvent)m_Events.erase(event);return false;}return true;} bool TrustSafetySystem::IsBanned(const std::string&player)const{return m_Banned.contains(player);}uint8_t TrustSafetySystem::Score(const std::string&player)const{auto it=m_Scores.find(player);return it==m_Scores.end()?0:it->second;}uint64_t TrustSafetySystem::DeterministicState()const{uint64_t h=1469598103934665603ULL;for(const auto&a:m_Audit){for(unsigned char c:a.playerId){h^=c;h*=1099511628211ULL;}for(unsigned char c:a.eventId){h^=c;h*=1099511628211ULL;}h^=static_cast<uint8_t>(a.signal);h*=1099511628211ULL;h^=a.score;h*=1099511628211ULL;}return h;} }
